            <p>This Privacy Policy describes how sahebansari.com ("we," "us," "our," or "the Site") collects, uses, and shares information about you when you visit our website and use our services.</p>

            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

            <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Comments and Feedback:</strong> When you leave comments on blog posts, we collect the information you provide, including your name, email address, and comment content.</li>
                <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> If you contact us through the website, we collect the information you provide, including your name, email, and message.</li>
                <li><strong>Newsletter Subscriptions:</strong> If available, we collect email addresses from users who subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> When you visit our site, our servers automatically record information such as your IP address, browser type, referring URL, and pages visited.</li>
                <li><strong>Cookies and Tracking:</strong> We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze site traffic, and understand user behavior.</li>
                <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use analytics tools to monitor site performance, user engagement, and traffic patterns.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

            <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our website and content</li>
                <li>Respond to your comments, questions, and requests</li>
                <li>Send you marketing communications and newsletters (with your consent)</li>
                <li>Analyze site usage and improve user experience</li>
                <li>Detect and prevent fraud or security issues</li>
                <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>

            <p>Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to track visitor behavior, preferences, and engagement. These cookies help us understand how you interact with our content and allow us to personalize your experience.</p>

            <p>You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies or alert you when cookies are being sent. Note that disabling cookies may affect your experience on our site.</p>

            <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

            <p>We may use third-party services for analytics, advertising, and other purposes. These third parties may collect information about you in accordance with their own privacy policies. We encourage you to review their privacy policies to understand their practices.</p>

            <h2>Data Security</h2>

            <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

            <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

            <p>Our website is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child under 13, we will take steps to delete such information and terminate the child's account.</p>

            <h2>Your Rights and Choices</h2>

            <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>The right to access your personal information</li>
                <li>The right to correct or update your information</li>
                <li>The right to delete your information</li>
                <li>The right to opt-out of marketing communications</li>
            </ul>

            <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us at me@sahebansari.com.</p>

            <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. We will notify you of any material changes by updating the "Last Updated" date below. Your continued use of the website following the posting of revised Privacy Policy means that you accept and agree to the changes.</p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>

            <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us at:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> me@sahebansari.com</li>
                <li><strong>Website:</strong> sahebansari.com</li>
            </ul>

